{"id":"a797b7e3c0ca674d","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-dense-strings.md","title":"串条件中的稠密与稠密开集","display":"df-dense-strings — 串条件中的稠密与稠密开集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-dense-strings","aliases":["20-df-dense-strings"],"display":"df-dense-strings — 串条件中的稠密与稠密开集","chapter":"6","section":"6.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 6.3.1；§14.2","source_pdf_pages":[171],"source_printed_pages":[137],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-dense-strings"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-dense-strings</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dense-strings — 串条件中的稠密与稠密开集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 6.3.1；§14.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>171</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>137</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<p>本条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span> 的量词域均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dense\\text{-}strings}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{DenseStrings}(S)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\ \\exists\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ [\\tau\\in S],\\\\\n\\operatorname{OpenStrings}(S)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\in S\\ \\forall\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ [\\tau\\in S].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dense\\text{-}strings}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{DenseStrings}(S)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\ \\exists\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ [\\tau\\in S],\\\\\n\\operatorname{OpenStrings}(S)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\in S\\ \\forall\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ [\\tau\\in S].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span> 的类型均为有限二进制串。OpenStrings 指延伸闭合，对应拓扑中的基本开柱并。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 6.3.1；§14.2；印刷页 137；PDF 第 171 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dense\\text{-}strings}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{DenseStrings}(S)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\ \\exists\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ [\\tau\\in S],\\\\\n\\operatorname{OpenStrings}(S)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\in S\\ \\forall\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ [\\tau\\in S].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau","display":false}],"bytes":1213,"backlinks":[{"id":"88fbecf58d4e0c66","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-dense-strings]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-dense-strings]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-dense-strings]] — 章 6；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-dense-strings]]"}],"outgoing":["755e421576224435"]}